title: User onboarding
direction: down

start: Sign up [pill, green]
verify: Verify e-mail
verified: Verified? [diamond]
resend: Resend link [rounded]
profile: Complete profile
invite: Invite teammates [rounded, detail: optional]
done: Workspace ready [pill, green]

start -> verify -> verified
verified -> profile: yes
verified -> resend: no
resend ..> verify
profile -> invite -> done

comment on invite: Can we skip this for solo users?
